{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110494","id":2825833373,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6obsud","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110494","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110494.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110494.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110494","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110494/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110494/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110494/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bfa330dd5dc6f4894efc956db1be20e4bc2d0064","number":110494,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add MULTIMESH_TRANSFORM_SKIP to reduce memory usage","user":{"login":"JaredGivens","id":54290147,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjkwMTQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54290147?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens","html_url":"https://github.com/JaredGivens","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Add MULTIMESH_TRANSFORM_NONE to reduce memory usage for instances without individual transforms\r\n### Motivation\r\nCurrently, Godot's MultiMesh requires a transform buffer (either 2D or 3D) for all instances, even in cases where no per-instance transforms are needed—such as when all instances share the same position/rotation/scale (e.g., particle effects, foliage, or UI elements rendered in batches). This forces unnecessary memory allocation for transform data (8 floats for 2D or 12 for 3D per instance), which can be significant for high-instance-count scenarios.\r\n### Changes\r\nThis PR introduces MULTIMESH_TRANSFORM_NONE to the MultimeshTransformFormat enum, allowing users to opt out of transform storage entirely. When enabled, the buffer can consist solely of per-instance colors (4 floats) and/or custom data (4 floats), reducing the per-instance stride to as low as 0 (if neither is used) or 4–8 floats. This can halve or more the memory footprint for transform-less use cases, benefiting memory-constrained games or mobile targets.","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-09-13T19:20:33Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T23:20:41Z","closed_at":"2025-09-25T09:43:04Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"fa5ea20ac4e91420928411784c0d70936a4bf738","assignee":null,"assigne